ML — Status: Functionally Complete for MVP
Every function called out in Section 16 of the document is implemented and working.

What is fully done:

Component	What's there
preprocess_sensor_data()	Full implementation — bounds validation, numeric coercion, median imputation for missing values
validate_reading()	Range checks for all 5 sensor channels with per-channel thresholds
engineer_features()	15 features — 5 raw channels + 3 ratio features + 2 polynomial features + 5 z-scores
detect_anomaly()	Full IsolationForest — trains, saves to disk as .pkl, loads on first use, returns is_anomaly, anomaly_score, anomaly_type
